{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "74081e5dfeb53b592cf8042edaf6a2eae0c9b89684847aeca9adc1eb5452237d", "ja": "はぁ……♪\n緑が多くて、空気が澄んでるねぇ。", "zh": "哇……♪\n一片绿油油的，空气也很清新呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "e830bc8ff664d1fdc5a63f9fbee39062d25feed9db4959809b886befd6238be3", "ja": "土のにおいは、やっぱし落ち着くよぉ。\n都会では、あんまし出会えないけども……。", "zh": "泥土的味道果然很令人安心～\n虽然在都市很难遇到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aaccb17eab612c7e4923ec34a0419e51ee96617a488c7f24103d903f1f260257", "ja": "（地方局の、のどかな旅番組ロケ。\nひなたには、ぴったりの仕事だな……）", "zh": "（这是地方电视台的悠闲旅游外景节目，\n真是再适合日向不过的工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "ac92ff2c94b78dc38cc5d23f1e0dc242bd430c43c08895e94ecac29695120359", "ja": "なんだか、田舎を思い出すよぉ。\n歌いたくなるねぇ……♪", "zh": "总觉得让人想起了乡下～\n开始想唱歌了呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "5dd04ac327b44e76d898da134dd4975d8d9aa8efabdfbed16dff3a15699a5c00", "ja": "{$P$}も、一緒に歌うかい？\n青空の下で歌うと、なまら気持ちいいべさ！", "zh": "{$P$}也一起唱歌吧？\n在蓝天下唱歌，一定特舒服的哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ebf2b5ec9dbbbc4f45a8db7c7b97088ef058fe0444c764027c5839629730b4a7", "ja": "いや、俺は遠慮しておくよ……\nあと歌うのは、休憩中だけな！", "zh": "不，我就不用了……\n还有，只能在休息时间唱歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
